rs_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T09:53:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T09:53:29Z","body":"\r\n@blueskythlikesclouds \r\nThis PR may be considered a general improvement that also solves the #120637, because use of dedicated vkCmdResolveImage instead of an empty render pass makes more sense for me and for drivers. Unless the new image usage flags block **some** optimizations on **some** TLDR GPUs, I'm not able to test this :scream_cat:.\r\n\r\nThe exact crash reason is really just two empty render passes with color attach and resolve STORE_OP_DONT_CARE attach submitted in sequence (into one command buffer ? I didnt try to separate command recording, but its very likely). \r\nFrom vulkan api thats legal whereas nvidia goes crazy. Maybe textures from #113781 also use empty render passes. \r\n\r\nI dont think that making Nvidia specific workaround worth it, cause Nvidia since Maxwell uses TLDR based rasterization so it may (or may not if driver is smart enough) trigger performance regressions, especially on older Nvidia GPUs that may not even have the issue, I didnt find anyone who has tested the crash scenario on GPU older the RTX 30xx series. \r\nAnd the workaround adds more code complexity to the already scrambled code. \r\n\r\nPerformance... performance....  performance... :see_no_evil:","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5044401899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5044674518","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121595#issuecomment-5044674518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121595","id":5044674518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLK-f1g","user":{"login":"PateevK","id":171885206,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj7Clg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171885206?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK","html_url":"https://github.com/PateevK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T10:23:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T10:23:03Z","body":"Later I'll try to make sence of #118361","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5044674518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]